<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Geon raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Geon raised to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer raised its rating on Geon Co to outperform from market perform, an Oppenheimer source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
